      "updated": 1787898718995,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- State：What situation am I in right now?\n\n- Action：Actions performed \n\n- Transition：Actions change the environment gain new State\n\n\n\n- Reward：Immediate feedback obtained from the environment after an action is performed\n\n\n\n\n- Discount：Used to weigh the importance of current rewards against future rewards.",
